				176,
				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Deps): Advance Tauri submodule with Cargo, Dependency, and NPM formatting fixes\n\nUpdate the Tauri dependency submodule to revision 834b90b0, which advances three nested submodules within the Tauri dependency tree:\n\n- **Cargo:** Reformat README HTML table with proper indentation, line breaks, and self-closing tags for readability.\n- **Dependency:** Advance PluginsWorkspace, TauriDocs, and TauriSearch submodules. PluginsWorkspace converts the shell plugin permission reference table to flat tab-indented format. TauriDocs normalizes markdown formatting across 35 plugin READMEs, 35 permission reference files, and core permission docs with consistent table indentation, self-closing image tags, and compact structure. TauriSearch fixes malformed markup in seven pattern guide test fixtures by adding missing closing `</rater>` tags inside table cells.\n- **NPM:** Restructure README HTML table with consistent indentation, self-closing void element tags, and line breaks for improved maintainability.\n\nAll changes are formatting normalization and bug fixes with no semantic alterations. Keeps the Land editor's Tauri dependency tree aligned with upstream improvements.",
			"SHA": "b521c5b152139a5980b5f7fea5b113b86725175e"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-07T16:56:19Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				176,
				3
			],
			"Message": "style(Deps): Advance Biome, OXC, and Tauri submodules with README formatting fixes\n\nBiome restructures its dependency README with proper HTML indentation, self-closing tags, and HTML entities for whitespace across seven repository entries (Biome, BiomeIntelliJ, BiomeLand, DiscordUtilsBot, PreCommit, Resources, SetupBiome). OXC corrects malformed HTML table structure in its showcase — fixes nested <picture> element containing emoji link, realigns <tr>/<td> boundaries, and uses valid self-closing tags. Tauri advances two nested submodules: PluginsWorkspace reformats permission reference tables (dialog, fs, log, shell plugins) from flat tab-indented to expanded multi-line structure with blank-line separation; TauriSearch removes extraneous </rater> closing tags from seven pattern guide test fixtures that caused malformed nesting.\n\nAll changes are purely presentational — preserve every repository link, badge URL, and semantic content while improving markup standards compliance and rendering reliability across GitHub and markdown viewers.",
			"SHA": "32a81b45b73e4dc8517ce702bc9dc9ff7de03319"
		}
